<header class="hero">
  <div class="hero-inner hero-flex">
    <div class="hero-text">
      <div class="kicker">Stories about uncommon women of Pakistan — and who's in their corner</div>
      <h1 class="hero-title">She's doing more than anyone sees. Someone should say so.</h1>
      <p class="hero-sub">Heard, But Unheard tells the stories of Pakistani women carrying more than their share — and asks a simple question: who is actually appreciating this, and who is offering real encouragement, not just sympathy. Every story is paired with people who can help, and space for the appreciation these women rarely get to hear.</p>
      <div class="hero-actions">
