<section id="resources">
  <div class="wrap">
    <div class="section-head">
      <div class="section-icon"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="#0b4228" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M12 2 4 6v6c0 5 3.4 8.4 8 10 4.6-1.6 8-5 8-10V6z"/><path d="M9 12l2 2 4-4"/></svg></div>
      <h2>Who's in her corner</h2>
      <p>A working directory of established, free helplines and legal aid organizations operating in Pakistan — for when appreciation isn't enough and real support is needed too. Coverage and hours vary by province.</p>
    </div>

    <div class="res-group">
      <h3>Immediate safety & crisis</h3>
      <div class="res-item">
        <div><div class="res-name">Police Emergency</div><div class="res-desc">For any immediate danger.</div></div>
        <div class="res-contact">15</div>
      </div>
      <div class="res-item">
        <div><div class="res-name">National Domestic Violence Helpline</div><div class="res-desc">24/7 helpline under the Domestic Violence (Prevention and Protection) Act, 2026.</div></div>
        <div class="res-contact">1121</div>
      </div>
      <div class="res-item">
        <div><div class="res-name">Ministry of Human Rights Helpline (1099)</div><div class="res-desc">Free, nationwide helpline and app to report abuse and access legal referrals.</div></div>
        <div class="res-contact">1099</div>
      </div>
      <div class="res-item">
        <div><div class="res-name">Punjab Women's Helpline</div><div class="res-desc">Province-specific support line for women in Punjab.</div></div>
        <div class="res-contact">1043</div>
      </div>
      <div class="res-item">
        <div><div class="res-name">Edhi Foundation</div><div class="res-desc">24/7 emergency response, ambulance, and shelters for women across Pakistan.</div></div>
        <div class="res-contact">115</div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="res-group">
      <h3>Counseling & gender-based violence support</h3>
      <div class="res-item">
        <div><div class="res-name">Rozan Helpline</div><div class="res-desc">Free telephone counseling for women and children, Mon–Sat, 10am–6pm.</div></div>
        <div class="res-contact">0800-22444</div>
      </div>
      <div class="res-item">
        <div><div class="res-name">Bedari Helpline</div><div class="res-desc">Support for gender-based violence, forced/child marriage, and discrimination, Mon–Fri 9am–5pm.</div></div>
        <div class="res-contact">0300-5251717</div>
      </div>
      <div class="res-item">
        <div><div class="res-name">Dastak Shelter & Crisis Center</div><div class="res-desc">24/7 helpline, free legal aid, and shelter for women survivors of violence.</div></div>
        <div class="res-contact">dastak.org.pk</div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="res-group">
      <h3>Legal aid — maintenance, khula & domestic labor rights</h3>
      <div class="res-item">
        <div><div class="res-name">AGHS Legal Aid Cell</div><div class="res-desc">Free legal representation for women in family law, custody, and maintenance cases.</div></div>
        <div class="res-contact">aghs.org.pk</div>
      </div>
      <div class="res-item">
        <div><div class="res-name">Legal Aid Society Pakistan</div><div class="res-desc">Connects low-income women, including domestic workers, to pro bono lawyers.</div></div>
        <div class="res-contact">las.org.pk</div>
      </div>
      <div class="res-item">
        <div><div class="res-name">Aurat Foundation</div><div class="res-desc">Women's rights organization with offices in Islamabad, Lahore, Karachi, Peshawar & Quetta.</div></div>
        <div class="res-contact">af.org.pk</div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="res-group">
      <h3>Immigration, overseas employment & family separation</h3>
      <div class="res-item">
        <div><div class="res-name">Bureau of Emigration & Overseas Employment</div><div class="res-desc">Official information on overseas work visas and protections for workers' families.</div></div>
        <div class="res-contact">beoe.gov.pk</div>
      </div>
      <div class="res-item">
        <div><div class="res-name">Overseas Pakistanis Foundation</div><div class="res-desc">Support for families affected by a spouse's overseas migration or employment disputes.</div></div>
        <div class="res-contact">opf.org.pk</div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="res-group">
      <h3>Disability & caregiving support</h3>
      <div class="res-item">
        <div><div class="res-name">Special Talent Exchange Program (STEP)</div><div class="res-desc">Disability rights organization offering rehabilitation referrals and advocacy support.</div></div>
        <div class="res-contact">step.org.pk</div>
      </div>
      <div class="res-item">
        <div><div class="res-name">Milestone Society</div><div class="res-desc">Physiotherapy, mobility aids, and rehabilitation support for people with physical disabilities.</div></div>
        <div class="res-contact">milestonesociety.org.pk</div>
      </div>
      <div class="res-item">
        <div><div class="res-name">Edhi Foundation</div><div class="res-desc">Free ambulance transport, home nursing referrals, and elder-care support.</div></div>
        <div class="res-contact">115</div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="res-group">
      <h3>Widowhood, inheritance & maintenance rights</h3>
      <div class="res-item">
        <div><div class="res-name">National Commission on the Status of Women</div><div class="res-desc">Guidance on inheritance rights, harassment complaints, and legal referrals.</div></div>
        <div class="res-contact">ncsw.gov.pk</div>
      </div>
      <div class="res-item">
        <div><div class="res-name">Shirkat Gah Women's Resource Centre</div><div class="res-desc">Advocacy and legal support on inheritance, property, and family law disputes.</div></div>
        <div class="res-contact">shirkatgah.org</div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section id="share" class="share">
